### 📋 Secrets Management Best Practices

| Practice | Implementation |
|----------|----------------|
| **Never commit secrets** | Add all `.env*` files to `.gitignore` except `.env.example` |
| **Use different keys per env** | `sk-live-` for prod, `sk-test-` for dev |
| **Rotate regularly** | Automated rotation every 90 days |
| **Audit access** | Log all secret access with user/service identity |
| **Least privilege** | Each service gets only required secrets |
| **Encrypt at rest** | Secrets stored encrypted, decrypted at runtime |
| **No env var logging** | Never log `process.env` or secret values |
| **Memory only** | Don't write secrets to temp files or logs |

